WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:02.360
SCP-682 VS SCP-3660.

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:09.710
When the SCP Foundation tested SCP-3660 - The
Zoo Zipper, a zipper that hollows creatures

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:15.469
out and turns their insides into an animal
- against SCP-682, the Hard to Destroy Reptile,

00:00:15.469 --> 00:00:17.650
they were hoping to minimize the monster.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:21.080
The zipper was placed against the creature
while it slept and left in place.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:26.440
Within seven minutes, it did its thing, unzipping
682 and turning its body into dead rubber:

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:31.560
Only a tiny gecko with 682’s mind came out
of the mess, confused and angry.

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:35.679
Researcher Jettler entered the containment
chamber and stomped on the 682 gecko.

00:00:35.679 --> 00:00:37.399
Sadly, this didn’t work out.

00:00:37.399 --> 00:00:43.179
The 682 gecko suddenly became 682’s regular
size, while still retaining its gecko appearance,

00:00:43.179 --> 00:00:47.460
and ate Researcher Jettler, before breaching
containment and killing several more people.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:51.179
682 returned to its normal appearance over
the next two weeks.

00:00:51.179 --> 00:00:52.340
Test: Failed.

